Nethack is available by anonymous ftp at linc.cis.upenn.edu in the
subdirectory pub/NH3.0.   In this subdirectory are the following
directories:

   pub/NH3.0          - NetHack source
   pub/NH3.0/amiga    - Amiga binaries
   pub/NH3.0/atari    - Atari ST binaries
   pub/NH3.0/mac      - Macintosh binaries
   pub/NH3.0/os2      - OS/2 binaries
   pub/NH3.0/PC       - PC overlay binaries

Go to the appropriate subdirectory and download the files to
your system.  Be sure to type the word "binary" before you
attempt to transfer the .exe files (for PC anyway) because
they won't download correctly if you don't.

This info comes from a posting by Greg who gave some info on
this a couple months ago (he's on the Nethack team as his
posting said).  I hope it's still current.

